  "title": "Great apartments in a great location!",
  "language": "en",
  "originalLanguage": "en",
  "roomTip": null,
  "text": "The one bedroom apartment was well priced, comfortable & spacious. Well located to the CBD, light rail, interchange & waterfront dining precinct, plenty of paid parking on site & surrounding streets. We didn't like the coded keypads to enter the building & our room, many times we couldn't get out of the car park or into our room which was frustrating. We'd prefer the tried & proven swipe card or fob option!",
