  "title": "Great apartment but a terrible night sleep.",
  "language": "en",
  "originalLanguage": "en",
  "roomTip": null,
  "text": "The apartments are in excellent location. Our apartment was well equipped and great size. The night, however, was so noisy. Party upstairs all night. People running up and down hallway. It was impossible to sleep and ran from 11pm till 4pm. No one to notify as there is a call out fee for after hours assistance. Rooms not at all insulated. Doors banging throughout night and street noise.",
