  "url": "/ShowUserReviews-g255325-d19609416-r986564085-Honeysuckle_Executive_Apartments-Newcastle_Greater_Newcastle_New_South_Wales.html",
  "title": "Unacceptable Hygiene Standards",
  "language": "en",
  "originalLanguage": "en",
  "roomTip": null,
  "text": "Our recent stay at Honeysuckle Executive Apartments was deeply disappointing due to significant cleanliness issues.\n\nWhile searching for a misplaced AirPod, we removed the sheets and blanket from the bed and were shocked to discover blood stains on the sheets near the end of the mattress, possibly from a previous guest. After checking ourselves, it was clear the blood did not come from us, which made the discovery even more unsettling. Further inspection revealed yellow stains on the mattress protector, sesame seeds on the bed, and a drop of dried blood in the bathroom.\n\nThe cleanliness issues didn’t stop there. The blanket felt unclean, the bedside tables were dusty, and the floor was filthy, leaving black grease smudges on bare feet after walking barefoot. Additionally, itchy skin developed during the stay, further highlighting the lack of hygiene and adding to the discomfort.\n\nThese concerns were reported to reception, and a specific request was made for the bed sheets and linen to be replaced. The staff member said they would try to arrange for someone to address it. However, upon returning from a day trip, it was evident that nothing had been done. The same bloodstained sheets, dirty mattress protector, and other cleanliness issues remained.\n\nMaintaining cleanliness should be a basic standard for any accommodation, regardless of its price range. The unhygienic conditions made it impossible to feel at ease or enjoy a relaxing stay, resulting in a deeply disappointing experience. \n\nGiven this experience, I cannot recommend Honeysuckle Executive Apartments.",
  "username": "kevichii",
  "connectionToSubject": null,
  "absoluteUrl": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g255325-d19609416-r986564085-Honeysuckle_Executive_Apartments-Newcastle_Greater_Newcastle_New_South_Wales.html",
