  "url": "/ShowUserReviews-g255325-d19609416-r929616939-Honeysuckle_Executive_Apartments-Newcastle_Greater_Newcastle_New_South_Wales.html",
  "title": "Central location but shocking customer service, and wrong codes provided to enter!",
  "language": "en",
  "originalLanguage": "en",
  "roomTip": null,
  "text": "I booked into Honeysuckle Executive Apartments for myself and elderly parents during a recent trip. Due to my work commitments i initially emailed and  due to no response rang to try and arrange an early check in., which I was happy to pay for , but unsure on exact time. I spoke to a Harry, who was extremely rude and not at all helpful.\n\nI rang again the following morning to pay the early check in fee, as I wouldn’t be checking in at the same time as my parents. Harry left me on hold for roughly 8 minutes while he checked with housekeeping, despite arrangements being made the day earlier. I hung up and spoke to a lovely lady (Hannah I think) who assisted very quickly.\n\nUpon my sister arriving at property with my parents, they could be seen waiting at the front door, yet no one let them in. They were then greeted with  the comment ‘these early check in better slow down, housekeeping can’t keep up’\n\nMy sister was then belittled by male checking in, as we had not been provided the codes or check in details via text. I received these 25 minutes after the arranged arrival time. I called to speak to the manager, who once again needs to learn basic customer service and listen to guests when they are trying to speak! \n\nThe codes provided did not work for the doors, and they actually changed to code to pool without informing guests, or actual front desk staff! \n\nThe room was generally clean, but had rust marks throughout the bathroom and was not the cleanest apartment I had stayed in.",
  "username": "167katherinew",
  "connectionToSubject": null,
  "absoluteUrl": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g255325-d19609416-r929616939-Honeysuckle_Executive_Apartments-Newcastle_Greater_Newcastle_New_South_Wales.html",
