  "url": "/ShowUserReviews-g255325-d19609416-r923898723-Honeysuckle_Executive_Apartments-Newcastle_Greater_Newcastle_New_South_Wales.html",
  "title": "Wouldn't bother....",
  "language": "en",
  "originalLanguage": "en",
  "roomTip": null,
  "text": " 2 days before 3 of us were due to stay at another property in Newcastle, (a 2 bedroom apartment), I was called to say the apartment I had booked (Nouveau on Young) had become unavailable due to the people in it extending their stay.\nSuffice to say that a heated discussion entailed and even more so when the only alternative they offered was a 1 bedroom apartment with a trundle bed in the lounge room for my 70 year old sister to sleep in, in this so called \"Executive Apartment\" in a completely different suburb!!\n\nThe only recompense the SMUG manager offered was free parking! OR of course the other option of cancelling our booking and getting a refund....\nWe had booked the other apartment 6 months before our stay as it is very near the Stadium where we were seeing a concert and obviously the whole of Newcastle was booked out by the time it came to 2 days beforehand.\n\nThis apartment was ok, though not properly cleaned.\nThe bedroom is small, the furniture is old and worn. The verandah not maintained. It certainly isn't big enough for 3 people to stay in comfortably!\n\nThis company operates a string of properties in Newcastle and I would be wary of receiving any reliability, help, sympathy or recompense regarding your booking.",
  "username": "frankettey",
  "connectionToSubject": null,
  "absoluteUrl": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g255325-d19609416-r923898723-Honeysuckle_Executive_Apartments-Newcastle_Greater_Newcastle_New_South_Wales.html",
