  "url": "/ShowUserReviews-g255325-d19609416-r833461846-Honeysuckle_Executive_Apartments-Newcastle_Greater_Newcastle_New_South_Wales.html",
  "title": "Disgusting",
  "language": "en",
  "originalLanguage": "en",
  "roomTip": null,
  "text": "I checked in at 10pm to discover the room was absolutely filthy.\nIt hadn’t been cleaned from the party the night before.\nI even confirmed that afternoon I was coming at 10pm.\nNo one at the front desk, no one answered my multiple emergency calls, so I had no choice but to leave at midnight and find another hotel.\nNo one return 3 emails I sent the next day, on speaking with the very rude and aggressive Tony Hughes the Manager he not only didn’t even apologise, but he won’t refund my full monies paid and in fact wants to charge me a cancellation fee!\nThis is the worst, most unprofessional place I’ve ever booked.\nAvoid at all costs!",
